 class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579260/extras/image_en_04.png?t=1741717948\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have been granted special authority by the Queen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this manor, where neither police nor judge exist,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>only you possess the power to judge the suspects.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579260/extras/grill.gif?t=1741717948\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scoop out the hidden contradictions in their statements,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">poke at their lies until every deception is exposed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Burn away every lie until only the truth remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579260/extras/image_en_05.png?t=1741717948\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As food runs low, fear takes hold, suspicion grows\u2014and people vanish one by one\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you uncover every hidden secret and safely escape the manor?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579260/extras/image_en_06.png?t=1741717948\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo, you can experience Day 1 of the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve the case by reliving the day the investigators were first trapped in the manor.</p>","developers":["The Yellow Room"],"fullgame